{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:24-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.RETIRE-SAVINGS.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["es"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Por favor, utilice la tecla de retroceso para borrar."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Las teclas de flecha izquierda, arriba y abajo est\u00e1n desactivadas. Tambi\u00e9n lo est\u00e1n las teclas de inicio, fin, pgup y pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Utilice la tecla de retroceso para borrar."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Si el valor est\u00e1 seleccionado, s\u00f3lo tiene que empezar a escribir el nuevo valor para borrar el valor anterior."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Cuando se selecciona un n\u00famero (el valor se muestra en sentido inverso), utilice la tecla de flecha derecha para borrar la selecci\u00f3n sin borrar el valor. A continuaci\u00f3n, retroceda para editar."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["CONSEJO: En general, es mejor utilizar las teclas TAB o SHIFT-TAB para pasar de una entrada a la siguiente o a la anterior."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["SUGERENCIA 2: En general, la edici\u00f3n de un valor es ineficiente. Dado que los valores se seleccionan autom\u00e1ticamente, basta con escribir el n\u00famero que desee."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["No escriba el car\u00e1cter separador de miles."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Si se usa la convenci\u00f3n de EE.UU., ser\u00eda la coma.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["\u00a1Soy lo suficientemente inteligente como para introducirlos por ti!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Se ha producido un error de c\u00e1lculo de fecha desconocido."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Por favor, facil\u00edtenos sus datos y configuraciones para que podamos solucionarlo. Gracias."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["La fecha no es v\u00e1lida - a\u00f1o incorrecto."],"Jan":["ene"],"Feb":["feb"],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Abr"],"May":["Mayo"],"Jun":["Jun"],"Jul":["Jul"],"Aug":["Ago"],"Sept":["Sept."],"Oct":["Oct"],"Nov":["Nov"],"Dec":["Dic."],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Error: fechas fuera de secuencia."],"Exception":["Excepci\u00f3n"],"occurred when accessing":["se produjo al acceder a"],"Invalid index":["\u00cdndice no v\u00e1lido"],"YTD":["A\u00f1o a la fecha"],"Running Totals":["Totales acumulados"],"Your Personalized Retirement Schedule":["Su programa de jubilaci\u00f3n personalizado"],"Retirement Plan Summary":["Resumen del plan de jubilaci\u00f3n"],"Total Investment":["Inversi\u00f3n total"],"Number of Investments":["N\u00famero de inversiones"],"Return on Investment (ROI)":["Retorno sobre la inversi\u00f3n (ROI)"],"Total Gain":["Ganancia total"],"Gain on Investment":["Ganancia sobre la inversi\u00f3n"],"Last Cash Flow Date":["Fecha del \u00faltimo flujo de caja"],"Years":["A\u00f1os"],"Investment Schedule":["Calendario de inversiones"],"Year":["A\u00f1o"],"Date":["Fecha"],"Investment":["Inversi\u00f3n"],"Investment Gain":["Ganancia sobre la inversi\u00f3n"],"Net Change":["Cambio neto"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Annual Investment":["Inversi\u00f3n anual"],"Annual Interest":["Inter\u00e9s anual"],"Annual Investment Gain":["Ganancia anual sobre la inversi\u00f3n"],"Change in Balance":["Cambio en el saldo"],"Annual Investment and Interest Totals":["Totales anuales de inversi\u00f3n e inter\u00e9s"],"Accumulated Investment and Interest":["Inversi\u00f3n e inter\u00e9s acumulados"],"Amount Invested & Interest as Percentage of Total Value":["Cantidad invertida e inter\u00e9s como porcentaje del valor total"],"\"Net Change\" is change from prior period i.e. prior balance plus investment, plus gain on investment (interest).":["\"Variaci\u00f3n neta\" es la variaci\u00f3n respecto al periodo anterior, es decir, el saldo anterior m\u00e1s la inversi\u00f3n, m\u00e1s la ganancia de la inversi\u00f3n (intereses)."],"Running Investment":["Inversi\u00f3n acumulada"],"Running Interest":["Inter\u00e9s acumulado"],"Running Investment Gain":["Ganancia acumulada sobre la inversi\u00f3n"],"Total Deposits":["Total de dep\u00f3sitos"],"Total Interest Earned":["Total de intereses devengados"],"Total Value":["Valor total"],"Pct. of Total":["% del total"],"Your Personalized Cash Flow Schedule":["Su programa de flujo de caja personalizado"],"Current age must be greater than 0.":["La edad actual debe ser mayor que 0."],"\"Retirement Age\" must be greater than \"Current Age\"":["La \"edad de jubilaci\u00f3n\" debe ser mayor que la \"edad actual\""],"Retirement Savings Calculator \u2014 calculate savings required to reach retirement goal":["Calculadora de ahorros para la jubilaci\u00f3n: calcula los ahorros necesarios para alcanzar el objetivo de la jubilaci\u00f3n"],"<p>This calculator easily answers the question \"Given the value of my current investments how much do I need to save each month to reach my retirement goal?\"<\/p>":["<p>Esta calculadora responde f\u00e1cilmente a la pregunta: \"Dado el valor de mis inversiones actuales, \u00bfcu\u00e1nto debo ahorrar cada mes para alcanzar mi objetivo de jubilaci\u00f3n?\"<\/p>"],"<p>The user enters their \"Current Age\", their expected \"Retirement Age\", the \"Annual Interest Rate (ROR)\" (annualized Rate-of-Return one expects to earn) and \"Amount At Retirement\" (the goal amount).<\/p>":["<p>El usuario introduce su \"Edad actual\", la \"Edad de jubilaci\u00f3n\" esperada, la \"Tasa de inter\u00e9s anual (TIR)\" (Tasa de retorno anualizada que se espera ganar) y el \"Importe en la jubilaci\u00f3n\" (la cantidad objetivo).<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The calculator quickly calculates the required monthly investment amount and creates an investment schedule plus a set of charts that will help the user see the relationship between the amount invested and the return on the investment.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">La calculadora calcula r\u00e1pidamente el importe de inversi\u00f3n mensual requerido y crea un calendario de inversiones, adem\u00e1s de un conjunto de gr\u00e1ficos que ayudar\u00e1n al usuario a ver la relaci\u00f3n entre el importe invertido y el rendimiento de la inversi\u00f3n.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Retirement Calculator\" - one that calculates many more unknowns and one that calculates assuming retirement <b>income<\/b> and not a final lump sum then try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Si necesita una \"Calculadora de jubilaci\u00f3n\" m\u00e1s avanzada, una que calcule muchas m\u00e1s variables desconocidas y que calcule asumiendo <b>ingresos<\/b> de jubilaci\u00f3n en lugar de una suma global, pruebe la calculadora que se encuentra aqu\u00ed: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Ability to create, in one schedule, the pre-retirement and post-retirement cashflow? Print the chart? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">\u00bfNecesita m\u00e1s opciones, incluida la capacidad de resolver otras inc\u00f3gnitas? \u00bfCapacidad para crear, en un solo calendario, el flujo de caja antes y despu\u00e9s de la jubilaci\u00f3n? \u00bfImprimir el gr\u00e1fico? \u00bfExportar a archivos de MS Word&trade; (.docx) o MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx)? Por favor, visite <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Preparado para"],"Address":["Direcci\u00f3n"],"City, State  ZIP":["Ciudad, Estado  C\u00f3digo Postal"],"Prepared On":["Preparado el"],"Prepared by":["Preparado por"],"Phone":["Tel\u00e9fono"],"Email":["Correo electr\u00f3nico"],"Website":["Sitio web"],"Unknown":["Inc\u00f3gnita"],"u":["i"],"U":["I"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Las fechas deben ser el primer d\u00eda del mes."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Un objeto de fecha de JavaScript no v\u00e1lido."],"Monthly":["Mensual"]}}}